  ('khanh-le', 'Đèo Khánh Lê (QL27C Đà Lạt – Nha Trang)', 'Khanh Le Pass (QL27C Da Lat – Nha Trang)', 'Lâm Đồng – Khánh Hòa', 'Lâm Đồng – Khánh Hòa', 'motorbike', 141.9, '#2563EB', 'Cung đèo QL27C nối Đà Lạt với Nha Trang, xuyên Vườn quốc gia Bidoup – Núi Bà. Khu vực thôn Long Lanh (xã Lạc Dương) và đoạn đèo Khánh Lê nằm trong danh mục điểm lõm sóng do Sở KH&CN Lâm Đồng công bố.', 'QL27C mountain road from Da Lat to Nha Trang through Bidoup – Nui Ba National Park. The Long Lanh hamlet area (Lac Duong commune) and the Khanh Le pass are officially listed signal dead zones.', ST_GeogFromText('SRID=4326;LINESTRING(108.43728 11.94352, 108.43746 11.94329, 108.43673 11.94265, 108.43757 11.94041, 108.43650 11.93938, 108.43524 11.93906, 108.43337 11.93940, 108.43158 11.94085, 108.43343 11.94212, 108.43412 11.94359, 108.43403 11.94450, 108.43477 11.94500, 108.43479 11.94613, 108.43590 11.94745, 108.43541 11.94944, 108.43413 11.95048, 108.43225 11.95289, 108.43180 11.95492, 108.43453 11.95763, 108.43491 11.95871, 108.43473 11.95980, 108.43319 11.96279, 108.43126 11.96340, 108.43131 11.96403, 108.43259 11.96558, 108.43190 11.96684, 108.43138 11.96714, 108.43008 11.96707, 108.42851 11.96831, 108.42693 11.97105, 108.42392 11.97328, 108.42247 11.97536, 108.42072 11.97658, 108.41971 11.97789, 108.41813 11.97867, 108.41788 11.98250, 108.41672 11.98393, 108.41676 11.98651, 108.41789 11.99071, 108.41857 11.99155, 108.41953 11.99450, 108.41939 11.99684, 108.41855 11.99832, 108.41547 12.00082, 108.41494 12.00217, 108.41574 12.00382, 108.41788 12.00438, 108.41898 12.00525, 108.41933 12.00625, 108.41916 12.00869, 108.42195 12.00897, 108.42427 12.01018, 108.42537 12.00951, 108.42599 12.00969, 108.42672 12.00995, 108.42761 12.01196, 108.43243 12.01763, 108.43496 12.01885, 108.43541 12.02044, 108.43703 12.02129, 108.43826 12.02070, 108.44242 12.02053, 108.44360 12.02102, 108.44415 12.02190, 108.44592 12.02242, 108.44688 12.02091, 108.44857 12.02014, 108.44836 12.01735, 108.45033 12.01449, 10